REVERSE ENGINEERING NOTICE:

This software implements the Water.io BLE protocol through reverse engineering
of the Water.io Android application (APK versions 3.5.0 and 4.8.6) for the sole
purpose of enabling interoperability with Home Assistant.

This implementation:
- Contains NO copied code from Water.io's proprietary application
- Is an independent, clean-room implementation written in Python
- Reverse engineering was performed for interoperability purposes only, which
  is generally protected under applicable laws (e.g., EU Software Directive
  Article 6, US fair use doctrine)
- Does not disclose trade secrets or confidential information
- Does not circumvent any technical protection measures

Water.io is a trademark of Water.io Ltd. This project is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Water.io Ltd.

THE AUTHORS MAKE NO WARRANTY THAT THIS SOFTWARE WILL NOT INFRINGE ANY THIRD
PARTY RIGHTS. USE AT YOUR OWN RISK.
